<h1>About</h1>
<p class="lead">I'm Aamir Khan, a Technical Project Manager based in Germany.</p>
<p>At <a href="https://featherflow.de">FeatherFlow</a>, a product agency, I sit between clients and engineers. I scope AI products, keep delivery on track, and make sure what we build actually solves the problem.</p>
<p>I have a bachelor's degree in computer science, so I can follow the technical conversation and translate it into decisions a business can make.</p>
<p>I grew up across several countries, including Turkey and Germany, and speak English, German, Turkish and Hindi. That background shapes how I work: lots of listening, and clear communication across cultures.</p>
<h2>What I care about</h2>
<ul>
<li>Building AI products that are useful, not just impressive</li>
<li>Clear processes that let small teams ship fast</li>
<li>Public speaking and sharing what I learn</li>
</ul>
<p>Want to talk? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.</p>
